# Deny everything, then allow only what the build needs. Written this way round
# because .pixi/ holds ~10 GB of installed environments and is not gitignored, so
# an allow-list is the only safe default.
*
!pyproject.toml
!pixi.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!presto

# ...but not the demo outputs shipped inside the package.
presto/data/example_run_single
**/__pycache__
